    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48bb143a9e5868b8e8d07283",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "男女老幼齐聚，别说不同国家了，\n参加者中甚至有些像是穿越过来的人物――",
      "source_fingerprint": "41e5a8c5c59405bc0959207f2fff23b9847a2c7b29a17a9f449422ba5168414c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055118.json",
      "json_path": [
