        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9b7f682f0b8e7b685093aaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的心愿是向全世界传递美丽。\n看到此番盛况，就能明白她的心愿离实现不远了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b863e9634d84cf0f7e3521e54463a5859aba130919d031135c9be2ed59848ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59241eadd4b8aeee5ab4c18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如愿以偿。\n美丽周日的话，\n一定会笑着说这也是一种美丽吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "889f2ed3808c32f53e041ac45bb643a9666e63959c230b10d71bba30b4b5f8f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57c4beb41cd83ad792de84e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但就在这时，会场被白色的光芒笼罩――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8eff6ea3b0e1721abed6135f2564bc280f19a2899c7ec85c992b9a917b2db9e",
